@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
scale 1.2
title User Voucher Search & Balance Inquiry

autonumber
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment center
hide footbox
skinparam actorStyle awesome

' Monochrome styling matching reference
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor yellow
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white

actor "User" as User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Wallet Service" as API
database "Database" as DB

== Balance & Voucher Inquiry ==

User -> App : Open "My Wallet" Screen
activate App

App -> API : GET /vouchers (status=ACTIVE)
activate API

API -> DB : Query vouchers by UserID
activate DB
note right
  **Query Logic:**
  Excludes 'EXPIRED' or 'DEPLETED'
  items to show only usable funds.
end note
DB --> API : Return Voucher
deactivate DB

API --> App : Return {Amount, Other details}
deactivate API

App -> User : Display Available Balance & Items
deactivate App

== End ==
@enduml